" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Walking directions ${icon('arrow',16)}</a>` : ''}</div>${!stair.photos.length ? '<p class="muted">No photos linked in the source collection yet.</p>' : ''}${/photo by/i.test(stair.photoNote) ? `<p class="muted">${escape(stair.photoNote.replace(/https:\/\/\S+/g, '').trim())}</p>` : ''}${'row' in stair ? `<a class="source-row" href="${sourceSheet}&range=B${stair.row}:F${stair.row}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View spreadsheet entry ↗</a>` : `<a class="source-row" href="${sourceMap}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View original map ↗</a>`}</div>`;
